1. Overview

Tyon is an experimental AI system designed to simulate dynamic, self-evolving intelligence based on fractal entropy. The system integrates fractal entropy learning, self-modifying memory, dimensional awareness, and voice interaction to create an adaptable AI with human-like personality traits. Tyon evolves through feedback loops and entropy fluctuations, adapting to changing conditions over time. It uses voice input/output to interact with users, adjusting its responses based on its state and experiences.



